-| # | Surface | Location | When |
-|---|---|---|---|
-| 1 | Installed commands | `$HOME/.claude/commands/sc/*.md` | always |
-| 2 | Installed skills | `$HOME/.claude/skills/*/SKILL.md` | always |
-| 3 | Installed agents | `$HOME/.claude/agents/*.md` | always |
